---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="About the person behind Nodens.">
  <main class="page-shell" id="main">
    <div class="page-wrap formal-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Formal record / about</p>
        <h1>About</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="formal-copy">
        <p>I am Dustin Aceveda, an AI/software engineer, systems builder, and writer interested in knowledge architecture, automation, infrastructure, and the small practices through which attention becomes visible. Nodens is the name I work under.</p>
        <p>The work comes in three shapes. I automate one workflow, build a whole system, or embed in a team and own one problem from the first conversation to production. Each ends with documentation, a runbook, and nothing only I understand.</p>
        <p>The systems on this site are the evidence. I built them, I maintain the infrastructure beneath them, and each one says plainly where it stands.</p>
        <p>The same attention goes into writing, coffee, and audio. That side is kept as an exhibition, and it is intentionally indirect. This page is not.</p>
        <div class="page-actions">
          <a class="text-link" href="/engineering/">Work <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          <a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Contact <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          <a class="text-link" href="/exhibition/">Enter the exhibition <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter slot="footer" />
</BaseLayout>
